  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#the-p-element\n> Contexts in which this element can be used:\n> - Where flow content is expected.\n\n　↓\n\nThe above should be fixed following:\n> Contexts in which this element can be used:\n> - Where flow content is expected.\n> - **As the child of a hgroup element.**\n\n\nRef: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/sections.html#the-hgroup-element\n> Content model:\n> - Zero or more p elements, followed by one h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, or h6 element, followed by zero or more p elements, optionally intermixed with script-supporting element",
